{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:9810bb779227791d","name":"Trickery Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-9810bb779227791d","title":"Trickery Talent Tree","revision":19801,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:37:42Z","sha256":"da94d233ecb7234ee2e42552950399a2ef7d7c66b375d0c1913cac4b7a886896","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19801","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Trickery%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-9810bb779227791d","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Charlatans"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charlatans"}," are masters of misdirection, confusion, and trickery. They owe their success in double-cross to their uncanny knack for cultivating the existing beliefs of their marks and twisting them in subtle ways to their own benefit.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Cunning Distraction"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When you successfully ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feint"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feint","referenceId":"reference:82a1660a47a16b62"}," an opponent in combat, you can immediately ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move","referenceId":"reference:6ecc3df6bffdd06c"}," up to one-half your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Damaging Deception"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Cunning Distraction"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You know how to distract a target, exposing weak spots that your allies can exploit. As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", you can make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"}," check against the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"}," of any target within your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," that can see, hear, and understand you. If successful, the next attack made by one of your allies made before the start of your next turn against that target deals 2 additional dice of damage.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Distracting Shout"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Cunning Distraction"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter, as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"}," to one of your allies being attacked, you can make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"}," check, replacing the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Defense Scores"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Defense_Scores"}," of that ally with the result of your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"}," check for the resolution of that attack. If any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Defense Scores"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Defense_Scores"}," are higher than the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"}," check result, your ally can use that ",{"tag":"a","children":["Defense Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Defense_Score"}," instead. If the attack still hits, this does not count as the one use per encounter aspect of this Talent.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Improved Soft Cover"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Innocuous"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["While you occupy a square adjacent to another creature, you can use a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," to gain a +2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cover"}," bonus to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," until the start of your next turn or until you are no longer adjacent to another creature, whichever comes first.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Innocuous"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", you can make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"}," check against a single enemy within 6 squares of you and in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"},". If the check equals or exceeds the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},", the target takes a -5 penalty on all attacks made against you until the start of your next turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Treacherous"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Improved Soft Cover"]},", ",{"tag":"b","children":["Innocuous"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you are attacked in combat and adjacent to a creature other than your attacker, you can move 1 square as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"},". The attack, intended for you, instead targets the adjacent creature, though if you move away from a creature that ",{"tag":"a","children":["Threatens"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Threatens"}," you, it can make an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attack of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attack_of_Opportunity"}," before the original attack is resolved.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
